  "prefLabel": "Vet 503.01 Adoption of AVMA Guidelines for the Euthanasia of Animals: 2020 Edition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 503.01 Adoption of AVMA Guidelines for the Euthanasia of Animals: 2020 Edition. All licensed veterinarians shall comply with the AVMA Guidelines for the Euthanasia of Animals: 2020 Edition, available as noted in Appendix II and except where vet rules have a stricter requirement.\n\nSource. #13466, eff 10-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/vet100-1000.html"
